    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.15em;margin-bottom:10px;\">HIRING A PUBLIC ROOM</div><p style=\"font-style:italic;\">Example</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; the Main Hall &ndash; seats <span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">200</span></p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Room and cost</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; the <strong>1</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"1\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> Room &ndash; seats 100</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cost of Main Hall for Saturday evening: <strong>2</strong> &pound;<input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"2\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;+ &pound;250 deposit (<strong>3</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"3\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> payment is required)</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Cost includes use of tables and chairs and also <strong>4</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"4\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Additional charge for use of the kitchen: &pound;25</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Before the event</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Will need a <strong>5</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"5\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> licence</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Need to contact caretaker (Mr Evans) in advance to arrange <strong>6</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"6\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">During the event</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The building is no smoking</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The band should use the <strong>7</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"7\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> door at the back</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Don&rsquo;t touch the system that controls the volume</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; For microphones, contact the caretaker</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">After the event</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Need to know the <strong>8</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"8\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> for the cleaning cupboard</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; The <strong>9</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"9\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> must be washed and rubbish placed in black bags</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; All <strong>10</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"10\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> must be taken down</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Chairs and tables must be piled up</p></div></div>",
