    "formContent": "<div class=\"ielts-form-container\"><div class=\"form-section\"><div class=\"form-title\" style=\"text-align:center;font-weight:700;font-size:1.2em;margin-bottom:10px;\">Ocean Biodiversity</div><p style=\"font-weight:700;\">Biodiversity hotspots</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; areas containing many different species</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; important for locating targets for <strong>31</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"31\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; at first only identified on land</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Boris Worm, 2005</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; identified hotspots for large ocean predators, e.g. sharks</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; found that ocean hotspots:</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; were not always rich in <strong>32</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"32\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; had higher temperatures at the <strong>33</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"33\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; had sufficient <strong>34</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"34\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> in the water</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Lisa Ballance, 2007</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; looked for hotspots for marine <strong>35</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"35\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; found these were all located where ocean currents meet</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Census of Marine Life</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; found new ocean species living:</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; under the <strong>36</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"36\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; near volcanoes on the ocean floor</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Global Marine Species Assessment</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; want to list endangered ocean species, considering:</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; population size</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; geographical distribution</p><p style=\"padding-left:42px;\">&ndash;&nbsp; rate of <strong>37</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"37\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; Aim: to assess 20,000 species and make a distribution <strong>38</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"38\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> for each one</p><p style=\"font-weight:700;margin-top:10px;\">Recommendations to retain ocean biodiversity</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; increase the number of ocean reserves</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; establish <strong>39</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"39\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"> corridors (e.g. for turtles)</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; reduce fishing quotas</p><p style=\"padding-left:18px;\">&bull;&nbsp; catch fish only for the purpose of <strong>40</strong> <input type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"new-password\" class=\"gap-input\" data-q=\"40\" style=\"width:130px;text-align:center;\"></p></div></div>",
